      <span class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">{t('cap.engineeringpage.text50_note')}</span> Performance data based on actual production runs of Ti-6Al-4V (Grade 5) aerospace and medical components. Results may vary by geometry complexity, tolerance requirements, and batch quantity.
